flowchart LR
  accTitle: Application replies
  accDescr: A local model extracts a reply type and quote. The tracker checks the quote against the message and identifies the specific role. Clear decisions are journalled in SQLite. Conflicting evidence goes to review.
  pages["Read collected<br/>email"] --> registry["Match employer<br/>and open roles"]
  registry --> quote["Extract quote<br/>and reply type"]
  quote --> proof{"Quote and role<br/>verified?"}
  proof -.->|Unclear| review["Queue for<br/>human review"]
  proof -->|Verified| write["Log decision<br/>in SQLite"]
  write --> views["Refresh<br/>tracker"]
